      "text": "Watching from Malaysia 🇲🇾. In 2010 I  was in North Sudan under UN Mission .I forgot the name off the small  district. I met two Policewomen. They were two sisters from Vanuatu While we were discussing about vacations,  she told me she yet to take any vacations back to her home because it's too far. And she told little bit about her place. I was imaging the worst about her homes. Today when  I saw their  place in this Documentary, \nWOW! WOW! It's a beautiful and wonderful place  I hope they both are happy and and fine\nIf you both come across this comment, Please reply. We may correspond via YT. Thank you 😊",
